      "runtime": 77,
      "language": "AR",
      "synopsis_en": "Qinawi, a physically challenged peddler who makes his living selling newspapers in the central Cairo train station, is obsessed with Hanuma, an attractive young woman who sells drinks. While she jokes with him about a possible relationship, she is actually in love with Abu Siri, a strong and respected porter at the station who is struggling to unionize his fellow workers to combat their boss' exploitative and abusive treatment.",
      "synopsis_zh": "尤瑟夫·夏因凭借这部杰作奠定了其国际声誉。影片虽在埃及上映初期遭遇商业失败，却最终成为整个阿拉伯电影史上最具影响力与盛名的作品之一。夏因亲自饰演报贩肯纳威——一位残疾青年，他对妩媚的饮料摊女郎（亨德·罗斯托姆，被誉为“阿拉伯的玛丽莲·梦露”）的痴迷，在开罗街头引发了一场歌剧规模的悲剧。本片融合新现实主义元素与极具冲击力的黑色情节剧，以粗粝的平民诗意为载体，探索个人在埃及后革命新政治秩序中寻找立足点的挣扎。[标准收藏]",
      "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zm8ET6PSfPT6pozgvjR7htaZFjy.jpg",
